{
  "slug": "claude-lens",
  "name": "Claude Lens",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Fast statusline for Claude Code with pace tracking. Shows quota remaining and whether you're ahead or behind ideal consumption pace -- green means headroom, red means slow down. Also displays context usage with trend arrows, git status, active tools, subagent/todo progress, and session speed. Pure Bash + jq, renders in ~50ms, O(1) transcript parsing, zero config required.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 command**, `setup` (Install the claude-pace statusline bundled with this plugin).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install claude-lens@claude-community` from `Astro-Han/claude-lens`.\n\nA lightweight Claude Code status line and rate limit tracker that shows your 5-hour and 7-day quota usage in real time. Pure Bash + jq, single file, zero npm.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "wrapper",
